<title>USA: Conso Products sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Conso Products sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>UNION, S.C. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conso Products Co said on Thursday its board of directors authorized a three-for-two stock split payable on October 4, 1996 to shareholders of record on September 16, 1996.</p>
<p>Each shareholder will receive on additional share of Conso's common stock for each two shares held on the record date, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk   212-859-1610</p>
